OL,5,Adecades
OL,6,
OL,7,FGraham was appointed to fill the seat
OL,8,Fin July after the sudden death of her
OL,9,Fbrother, Senator Lindsey Graham, a move
OL,10,Fthat won support from President Donald
OL,11,FTrump.
OL,13,FA political newcomer, she conceded
OL,14,Fduring the primary that she was "not
OL,15,Fthat informed on national security".
